    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. For 5...17...20 seconds, melee attacks against moving foes also Cripple those foes for 2...8...9 seconds. When you cast this enchantment, you are relieved of Cripple and 1 other condition. This enchantment ends after you apply Cripple 1...3...3 times.",
